      "title": "Checked Codeunit.Run with a write pending raises an error",
      "rootCause": "A Codeunit.Run whose Boolean result is used in StageRows runs while a database write may be pending (D50 TG Header, D50 TG Line, D50 TG Entry). A checked run needs a clean transaction: with a write pending, BC raises \"An error occurred and the transaction is stopped.\" at the run itself, the checked form does not catch it (the run does not return false), and nothing of the caller's is committed (measured on BC 28). Routine-level approximation: the writes may be pending on some callers' routes only.",
